/*
  NEXUS widgets — Indonesian.

  Only what iOS shows outside the widget itself: names and descriptions in the widget gallery, and the
  words of the "Edit Widget" sheet (scope, ring). Everything drawn INSIDE a widget follows the app's
  own language through GlanceText.t, because the phone's language and the app's can differ.

  Keys are the English source strings, one each. A key used twice (gallery name and picker option,
  e.g. "Today") is listed once.
*/

